<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>awayd – third-party licenses</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: Segoe UI, Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 960px; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; line-height: 1.4; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1em; font-size: 0.85em; }
  li { margin: 0.2em 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licenses</h1>
<p>awayd is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 or later (see <code>LICENSE</code>).
The executables include the following open-source components, listed by license.</p>

<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

<p>The fonts embedded in <code>awayd-settings.exe</code> (crate <code>epaint_default_fonts</code>)
are partly licensed under the Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0 (<code>LicenseRef-UFL-1.0</code>); its full
text is included as <code>UBUNTU-FONT-LICENCE.txt</code>.</p>

<h2>License texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<section>
  <h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
  <p>Used by:</p>
  <ul>
  {{#each used_by}}
    <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
  {{/each}}
  </ul>
  <pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
